### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  Library REST API — Generated
###
###  Start the server:
###    dotnet run --project path/to/project --urls "http://localhost:5201"
###
###  Then click "Send Request" above any request below.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ──────────── Books ────────────

### List all books
GET http://localhost:5201/api/books

### Get book by Isbn
GET http://localhost:5201/api/books/example-value

### Create a new book
POST http://localhost:5201/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Isbn": "example-isbn",
    "Title": "sample"
}

### ──────────── Patrons ────────────

### List all patrons
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons

### Get patron by Email
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value

### Create a new patron
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Email": "example-email",
    "LastOverdue": "2026-07-20",
    "Name": "sample",
    "Status": "sample"
}

### Action: CheckOut
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/checkOut
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "bookId": "example-book-id"
}

### Action: RenewAllActive
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/renewAllActive

### Action: RenewAndTag
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/renewAndTag

### Action: NotifyPatron
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/notifyPatron
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "message": 0
}

### ──────────── Loans ────────────

### List loans for patron
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/loans

### Get loan by id for patron
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/loans/1

### Action: MarkOverdue
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/loans/1/markOverdue

### Action: Return
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/loans/1/return

### Action: Renew
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/loans/1/renew

### Action: Return
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/example-value/loans/1/return

### ──────────── Fines ────────────

### List all fines
GET http://localhost:5201/api/fines

### Get fine by id
GET http://localhost:5201/api/fines/1

### Create a new fine
POST http://localhost:5201/api/fines
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Amount": 0,
    "Reason": "sample"
}

